    "detailed_description": "<strong>Zipp's Caf\u00e9 is a bite-sized cafe management sim with a noir-like story and cozy atmosphere.</strong><br><br>Can you really change? Can you escape your past? Can you find love? Can you handle betrayal? But most importantly... can you make the best coffee in all the Wilderness?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1812180/extras/a9e557cd271084cc859986129b6df3f1.avif?t=1745481260\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Zipp's Caf\u00e9 is a bittersweet little story of what we have to sacrifice to make a real difference in our lives while meeting extraordinary characters and preparing unusual recipes at the boiling edge of the cities of insects and animals.<br><br></li><li>Meet 5 strange characters and discover what connects them. Talk to them, and - whether you like it or not - get caught up in their lives. Immerse yourself into 3 minigames with completely different moods and mechanics. Brew the most special coffees or teas, prepare unique meals, and... wash the dishes... (Because someone has to do the dishes too, you know.) <br><br></li><li>Play in color, or in glorious NOIR mode!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1812180/extras/66ca3f60806863946aa68257b752aa7f.avif?t=1745481260\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1812180/extras/c0e378133e123d59fe2cc7b35df1e483.poster.avif?t=1745481260\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1812180/extras/c0e378133e123d59fe2cc7b35df1e483.webm?t=1745481260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1812180/extras/c0e378133e123d59fe2cc7b35df1e483.mp4?t=1745481260\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WORLD OF WILDERNESS</h2><br>The 'World of Wilderness' is a world and a brand, home to many different stories across multiple ages, and is constantly growing. Check our other games set in this universe:<br><br>Zipp's Caf\u00e9 is a precursor to the upcoming epic animal-noir-adventure:<br><strong>Chicken Police - Into the HIVE!</strong><br><br><br>...and it has an award-winning prelude too:<br><br><br>Not to mention a just-announced detective adventure:<br><br><br><i>Have fun playing Zipp's Caf\u00e9! - The Wild Gentlemen</i>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Zipp's Caf\u00e9 is a bite-sized cafe management sim with a noir-like story and cozy atmosphere.</strong><br><br>Can you really change? Can you escape your past? Can you find love? Can you handle betrayal? But most importantly... can you make the best coffee in all the Wilderness?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1812180/extras/a9e557cd271084cc859986129b6df3f1.avif?t=1745481260\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Zipp's Caf\u00e9 is a bittersweet little story of what we have to sacrifice to make a real difference in our lives while meeting extraordinary characters and preparing unusual recipes at the boiling edge of the cities of insects and animals.<br><br></li><li>Meet 5 strange characters and discover what connects them. Talk to them, and - whether you like it or not - get caught up in their lives. Immerse yourself into 3 minigames with completely different moods and mechanics. Brew the most special coffees or teas, prepare unique meals, and... wash the dishes... (Because someone has to do the dishes too, you know.) <br><br></li><li>Play in color, or in glorious NOIR mode!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1812180/extras/66ca3f60806863946aa68257b752aa7f.avif?t=1745481260\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1812180/extras/c0e378133e123d59fe2cc7b35df1e483.poster.avif?t=1745481260\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1812180/extras/c0e378133e123d59fe2cc7b35df1e483.webm?t=1745481260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1812180/extras/c0e378133e123d59fe2cc7b35df1e483.mp4?t=1745481260\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WORLD OF WILDERNESS</h2><br>The 'World of Wilderness' is a world and a brand, home to many different stories across multiple ages, and is constantly growing. Check our other games set in this universe:<br><br>Zipp's Caf\u00e9 is a precursor to the upcoming epic animal-noir-adventure:<br><strong>Chicken Police - Into the HIVE!</strong><br><br><br>...and it has an award-winning prelude too:<br><br><br>Not to mention a just-announced detective adventure:<br><br><br><i>Have fun playing Zipp's Caf\u00e9! - The Wild Gentlemen</i>",
    "short_description": "Love, betrayal, and coffee! Zipp's Caf\u00e9 is a &quot;noir &amp; chill&quot; little game about a caf\u00e9 between the city of animals and the district of insects. Make unusual recipes, get involved in shady dealings, and try to start a new life while searching for love and revenge.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Hungarian, Russian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cjump into Zipp\u2019s Caf\u00e9 for the noir vibes and wonderful characters, but stay for the utterly enjoyable drink and food-making\u201d<br>GameSpew<br><br>\u201cthe developer just loves their world and characters so very much.&quot;\u201d<br>Destructoid<br><br>\u201cThe game has more energy than a double espresso and is as addictive as that third cup of coffee you probably shouldn\u2019t have had\u201d<br>Geek Network<br>",
